Dependency boundary
-------------------

This repository does not include LMCache, SPDK, DPDK, ISA-L, ISA-L Crypto,
QEMU, libvfio-user, or vfio-user-kvssd source code or binaries. The native
connectors are built against separately obtained LMCache and SPDK checkouts.
The QEMU and vfio-user tools mentioned in documentation and functional tests
are external test prerequisites, not part of either connector package.

